# Technology Stack Decision – Document Conversion System

## 1. Backend Platform

### Node.js (Express)

Node.js የbackend መሠረት ሆኖ ይጠቀማል።

Responsibilities:

* File upload handling
* User request management
* Conversion job control
* Payment integration
* API communication with frontend
* Temporary file management
* Auto delete scheduling

Architecture:

```text
Framer Frontend

        ↓

Node.js Backend API

        ↓

Conversion Services
```

---

# 2. Core Conversion Engine

## LibreOffice

LibreOffice የዋና conversion engine ይሆናል።

Used for:

* PDF → Word
* Word → PDF
* Document format conversion
* Basic layout preservation

Reasons:

* Open source
* Free for commercial use
* Server environment compatible
* Supports multiple document formats
* Stable and widely tested

LibreOffice የnormal conversion path ይይዛል።

---

# 3. OCR Processing Layer

OCR ለnormal conversion አይገባም።

የሚጠቀመው:

* Scanned PDF
* Image documents
* Non-selectable text files

Workflow:

```text
Scanned PDF

↓

OCR Engine

↓

Recognized Text

↓

Document Reconstruction

↓

LibreOffice Conversion
```

OCR እንደ active processing layer ይሰራል።

---

# 4. Document Processing Layer

ይህ layer በOCR እና conversion መካከል ይሰራል።

Responsibilities:

* Text cleanup
* Character normalization
* Paragraph detection
* Table handling
* Layout preparation

በተለይ:

* Amharic documents
* Mixed language documents
* Complex layouts

ላይ ይረዳል።

---

