# 6. Storage Strategy

System ቋሚ የuser document storage አይጠቀምም።

Temporary processing files only.

Flow:

```text
Upload

↓

Temporary Processing

↓

Conversion

↓

User Save to Device

↓

Temporary File Delete
```

File lifetime policy:

* Server temporary files are automatically deleted according to project cleanup rules.
* User downloaded files remain only on the user's device.

---

# 7. Performance Strategy

Normal users በOCR processing አይጫኑም።

System routing:

```text
Normal Document

↓

Fast Conversion Path


Scanned Document

↓

Advanced OCR Path
```

Benefits:

* Faster response
* Lower server load
* Better stability
* Easier scaling

---

# 8. Future Upgrade Possibilities

Architecture ወደፊት ለሚከተሉት ክፍት ነው:

* Better OCR models
* AI document correction
* Advanced table extraction
* Document quality improvement
* More language support
* Enterprise document services

---

# Final Technology Decision

| Component         | Technology        | Purpose                      |
| ----------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Frontend          | Framer            | User interface               |
| Backend           | Node.js + Express | API and business logic       |
| Conversion Engine | LibreOffice       | Normal document conversion   |
| OCR Layer         | OCR Engine        | Scanned document recognition |
| Processing Layer  | Custom service    | Cleanup and reconstruction   |
| Storage           | Temporary storage | Short-term processing only   |

## Core Principle

The system must prioritize:

1. Stability over speed of development
2. Reliable user experience
3. Separation between normal and advanced processing
4. Ability to improve without rebuilding the entire platform
